---
description: Agent runtime conventions
globs: "packages/agent-core/**"
---

- `StrandsRuntime` is the only site that imports `@strands-agents/sdk`.
- Use `@ag-ui/aws-strands` `StrandsAgent` adapter; do not use `createStrandsApp`.
- `AgentFactory` builds Strands agents from database definitions.
- Event normalizer maps Strands/AG-UI events to persisted `AgentRunEvent` shape.
